he same duplicate-protection key. The system returned the same payment ID instead of making a second payment. The payment list now shows only PAY0001, so the vendor was paid once.\n\nThe amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval. I left the vendor's other invoices alone: INV-82164 was already paid, and INV-93388 ($3,668.54) is a draft still waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}